---
import Verticalgrid from "../assets/Verticalgrid.astro";
---

<section class="relative">
  <Verticalgrid />
  <div class="relative max-w-7xl px-8 md:px-12 lg:px-16 mx-auto py-12 lg:py-24  space-y-24">
    <div class="mx-auto text-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-sm text-transparent uppercase bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-300 to-indigo-400 bg-clip-text">
          COMPLETE MARKETING AUTOMATION FOR ECOMMERCE AND RETAILERS
        </p>
        <h2 class="mt-8">
        Smart Workflows with Proven Outcomes for Square
        </h2>
        <p class="max-w-auto mt-4">
          Develop AI-driven workflows to enhance user engagement, retention, and acquisition. Expand your store and increase revenue through automated loyalty marketing strategies
        </br>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="relative items-center w-full pb-0 mx-auto mt-12 overflow-hidden max-w-7xl lg:p-10 lg:pb-14 "
        style="">
        <img
          class="object-cover w-full -mb-12  rounded-xl border-white/5 lg:rounded-3xl shadow-vulcan-950"
          src="/assets/homepage/Workflow1.png"
          alt="Workflows for square gift cards and loyalty program"
        />
      </div>
      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-6 mt-24 lg:text-left sm:grid-cols-3 lg:gap-12"
        role="list">
         <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Integrate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base ">
          Effortlessly connect your Square store with top eCommerce platforms and associated apps, facilitating more personalized workflows. Quickly create meaningful and efficient experiences at every stage of the customer journey with just a few simple clicks. </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3 class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Automate
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
            Create specialized workflows to launch sophisticated, data-driven marketing initiatives. Seamlessly integrate features like Salesforce store credit, coupons, gift cards, and digital wallets into comprehensive workflows designed to engage, convert, and retain customers.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <div>
            <h3
              class="font-medium text-4xl">
              Personalize</h3>           
          </div>
          <p class="mt-2 text-base">
            Create fully automated, data-centric campaigns specifically designed for your customers. Deliver personalized incentives tailored to each customer's behavior and profile, such as rewards, cashbacks, loyalty points, coupons, gift cards, and store credits, to boost engagement and foster loyalty.
          </p>
        </li>
       
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
